I had the same problem. Here's one way to fix it:

Start Nethack and edit the window properties (right-click in the top
left-hand corner). Choose the Colors-tab, pick the dark blue color, and edit
its blue value to 255. Make sure screen background selection is still black.
Save settings for Nethack-type windows when done.

